Z||000009||Shaft||01-05-2001||07:28 PM||||GO FOR IT!!!!!!<P>CRX's are cool. The others are right when they say that any car on the road for that much is a deal. I'm not sure if the engine you're talkin about is what they call the "ZC" motor (which is the J-Spec version of the 1.6 that is already in the CRX) or if is what is called the B16A motor. The B16A is the 1.8L (?) motor that is in the Intergas. I've seen some web sites that show the details of the B16A swap and with that motor in a CRX you'd have a pretty wicked package. If you want those web sites I can give them to you after tomarrow when I'm back at school.||||reg||1
